33	/// The plaintext a device's Notification Service Extension decrypts and renders.
34	///
35	/// Serialized camelCase, matching the wallet's decoder. `pad` is the length-quantizing
36	/// filler; it is meaningless to the reader and is the last field so the arithmetic below can
